Online Store V15.9
- Restored the top-right System Status button; removed the obsolete V10.7 CSS rule that forcibly hid it.
- System Status diagnostics now show Cloud host, full last request URL, browser online/offline state, last successful revision and last successful Cloud time.
- Network failures preserve the full Supabase request URL without exposing the API key.
- Backup/Restore status text now preserves both action icons instead of replacing the button DOM after completion.
- Care Guide template textarea auto-grows to fit normal content and avoids the internal vertical scrollbar during editing.
- Backend schema unchanged; no SQL rerun required.

Online Store V15.8
- Backup now includes and validates bonsai content templates as first-class disaster-recovery data.
- Backup payload carries integrity counts for products, templates, history and local/accessory products; mismatches stop the operation.
- Backup filename now includes the live version: Lover_Legend_Online_Store_Backup_V15.8_DD-MM-YYYY.json.
- Restore invalidates v81TemplateCache / v81TemplateIndex / v81TemplateSignature and immediately refreshes template/product/accessory/current editor runtime state.
- Backup / Restore shows an operation lock screen, disables page navigation, blocks F5/Ctrl+R, and uses beforeunload protection until success/failure.
- Backup/Restore status buttons now show Backup 中 / Backup 成功 / Restore 中 / Restore 成功.
- Import inventory, average cost and Import minimum price remain read-only and excluded from Online Store Backup.
- Backend schema unchanged; no SQL rerun required.

Lover Legend Online Store V15.7
- Cloud diagnostics: preserve real HTTP/Supabase/RLS/permission/key/network errors and prevent renderStatus from overwriting lastError.
- Mobile pull-to-refresh: show "Cloud 没有新资料" when revision is unchanged and show full error detail on failure.
- Cloud Apply: consolidate to one runtime refresh path; invalidate template runtime cache once and repaint dependent views once.
- Header: remove ambiguous top "已同步 + 最后同步" widget; keep compact 系统状态 + 重新检查.
- Dashboard: remove standalone 系统状态 card.
- 系统状态 details now show Online Cloud, Revision, Cloud last sync, Import Read-Only Mirror, Import last check, and error detail.
- Backend schema unchanged; no SQL rerun required.

V15.6
- Fixed Cloud apply runtime refresh: invalidates Bonsai Content Template cache/index/signature before repaint.
- Mobile pull-down refresh triggers a safe Cloud revision check without full-page reload.
- Pull refresh shows checking/synced/failed status and preserves normal automatic sync.
- No Supabase schema change; V15.5 zero-login SQL remains valid.

Online Store V15.6
- Zero-login Cloud Sync: fixed Supabase Project URL / Publishable Key / Store ID are built into the deployment; new devices no longer enter Cloud settings or Auth email/password.
- New devices automatically read Cloud Revision and apply the Cloud master snapshot; if old local Online Store data exists, V15.6 keeps an automatic local safety snapshot before applying Cloud.
- Existing devices keep Local Cache first, 60-second lightweight revision checks, focus/visibility/network checks, 0.9-second save debounce, and revision conflict protection.
- Bonsai Content Templates remain part of the Cloud payload and save actions continue to mark Cloud dirty for automatic upload.
- Cloud settings UI simplified to status + revision + maintenance controls only.
- Added Backend/supabase_v155_zero_login.sql migration: anon may SELECT only lover-legend-main and may write only through the revision-safe RPC; direct anon table writes stay revoked.
- Version/build updated to V15.6 / 15600.

Online Store V15.4
- Automatic cross-device Cloud Sync after the first migration: startup, page focus/visibility return, network reconnect, pageshow, and a lightweight 60-second revision check.
- Saves continue to mark local data dirty and automatically push after a 0.9-second debounce; no manual sync is needed in normal daily use.
- Added lightweight revision-only checks so background monitoring does not download the full Cloud payload unless the revision changed.
- Existing devices restore Supabase sessions from the saved refresh token and check Cloud automatically without re-entering the password each time.
- A clean new device, after one-time Cloud login, automatically downloads the existing Cloud baseline when no meaningful local Online Store data exists; if local data already exists, V15.4 refuses automatic overwrite and asks for a manual choice.
- Preserved revision conflict protection, local-first display, Import read-only boundary, first-migration safeguards, manual maintenance buttons, and V15.3 password recovery.

Online Store V15.3
- Added Supabase Password Recovery handling for reset-email links.
- Added in-app new-password / confirm-password dialog and secure update flow.
- Added “忘记密码 / Reset” action beside Cloud Password to send a fresh recovery email.
- Recovery errors such as expired/invalid links are shown clearly instead of silently loading the home page.
- Password update does not change the Online Store data schema; Backend/supabase_v151.sql does not need to be rerun.
- Updated visible/runtime/cache/version markers to V15.3 / build 15300.

Online Store V15.2
- Redesigned Online Cloud Sync panel: Project URL + Publishable/Anon Key share one wide row; Store ID + Email + Password share the next row; compact revision/last-sync status and cleaner action buttons.
- Project URL and Publishable/Anon Key are no longer squeezed into narrow fields; no redundant copy buttons were added. Publishable/Anon Key is displayed as plain text because it is a browser-safe public key, while Cloud Password remains masked and unsaved.
- Fixed Supabase Auth diagnostics: a failed login now preserves and displays the real Supabase error instead of immediately reverting to “Cloud 已配置 · 尚未登录”.
- Existing V15.1 cloud table/RLS/RPC schema remains compatible; Backend/supabase_v151.sql does not need to be rerun solely for this UI/auth-diagnostic update.
- Updated visible/runtime/cache/version markers to V15.2 / build 15200.

Online Store V15.1
- Added Online Cloud Sync Foundation for cross-device Online Store data using Supabase Auth + RLS.
- Online-owned data only: product/room state, Online UI/pricing settings, history, bonsai templates, Holiday Mode, and Online Local Products. Import inventory/average cost/minimum price remain read-only and are never uploaded.
- Added explicit first migration with automatic local Backup before first upload/download; empty Cloud never auto-overwrites local data.
- Added monotonic Cloud revision conflict protection through the online_store_sync_push RPC. Conflicting revisions are blocked instead of overwritten.
- Added Local Cache first paint, debounced save push, and lightweight revision checks on startup/focus/visibility/online; no high-frequency polling.
- Added Settings Cloud panel for Project URL, Anon Key, Store ID, Auth login, Cloud check, first upload, download, manual sync, logout, revision and last-sync status.
- Expanded Online Store Backup/Restore to include templates, Holiday Mode and Online Local Products.
- Added Backend/supabase_v151.sql required to create the protected Cloud table, RLS policies and revision-safe RPC.

Online Store V15.0
- Consolidated profit-margin editing to one long-press controller; removed superseded V14.x long-press listeners/classes and duplicate room-label wrapper.
- Margin dialog adds Restore Default (current global target margin), keeps per-product/per-room override isolation, and left-aligns the editable rate.
- Negative target margin paints Online Sales Protection Floor red; non-negative protection floor remains blue.
- Room cards render a direct black VIP/Premium/Starter/Random label plus separate green draft / blue published state.
- Mother default price remains mandatory in all four bonsai rooms.
- Seller-paid shipping persists in roomShippingModes and immediately recalculates total cost, protection floor, net profit and margin.
- Restored one global Enter-to-next controller after field commit/validation.
- Preserved compact 1-8 accessory photo slots, one video, single Variation editor, Full Screen list, delete workflow, dynamic Add CTA and L-W-H-Weight order.

Online Store V14.9
- Root-cause fix: V14.8 incorrectly accessed top-level let state through window.*, causing margin long-press, accessory Add CTA, and live room shipping recalculation to see empty state.
- Profit-margin long-press now uses the actual lexical current product/room and opens after a 650ms hold.
- Four room cards show black room name + separate green draft / blue published state.
- Mother default price is required in VIP / Premium / Starter / Random and remains blocked below protection floor.
- Bonsai room shipping uses roomShippingModes only; buyer-paid/seller-paid switch recalculates cost/floor/profit/margin immediately.
- Accessory category pages always keep exactly one correctly named Add button.
- Keeps V14.8 compact 1-8 photo slots, single Variation editor, Full Screen list, global Enter navigation, delete workflow, and L-W-H-Weight order.

- Rebuilt target-margin long press with a document-capture controller that survives pricing DOM re-renders.
- Unified room draft labels: VIP/Premium/Starter/Random 草稿已保存.
- Consolidated accessory category Add CTA to one dynamic button and prevented CTA leakage into bonsai rooms.
- Added accessory Return to Product Management, video, free Variant Name, per-variation photo/stock/price/package/SKU, and main-product delete.

V14.6
- Replaced the repeatedly failing margin mouse/touch handlers with one Pointer Events long-press controller using pointer capture.
- Product ID + room are captured at press start, so editor/pricing re-renders cannot invalidate the margin edit action.
- Four bonsai rooms default single-product shipping to Buyer Pays; each product+room may switch to Seller Free Shipping and retain the saved room state.
- Removed accessory-product add CTAs from VIP / Premium / Starter / Random room headers; accessory creation stays in dedicated category modules.
- Preserved the V14.5 pricing, room, media, Variations, navigation and status behavior.

